cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this skill, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Academic Project Structure: An Agent Skill for Organizing Research Projects"
abstract: >-
  An agent skill for Claude and Codex that keeps academic research projects
  organized. It scaffolds new projects with a clean folder structure, audits
  and reorganizes existing ones without breaking replication, and runs
  periodic checks. Designed especially for quantitative research in R with
  Quarto or LaTeX; the structure also works for qualitative projects.
